ssage. Rather, they have not yet tasted My punishment.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"38:9","t":"Or do they have the depositories of the mercy of your Lord, the Exalted in Might, the Bestower?","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"38:10","t":"Or is theirs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and what is between them? Then let them ascend through [any] ways of access.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"38:11","t":"[They are but] soldiers [who will be] defeated there among the companies [of disbelievers].","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"38:12","t":"The people of Noah denied before them, and [the tribe of] ʿAad and Pharaoh, the owner of stakes,","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"38:13","t":"And [the tribe of] Thamūd and the people of Lot and the companions of the thicket [i.e., people of Madyan]. Those are the companies.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"38:14","t":"Each of them denied the messengers, so My penalty was justified.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"38:15","t":"And these [disbelievers] await not but one blast [of the Horn]; for it there will be no delay.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"38:16","t":"And they say, \"Our Lord, hasten for us our share [of the punishment] before the Day of Account.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":16,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":46,"surahs":[38],"sajdah":false}